  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Customer Transaction History",
      "id": "transaction-history",
      "intro": "Transaction History menampilkan riwayat lengkap transaksi customer berdasarkan HPAN signature. Berguna untuk analisis pattern dan deteksi anomali.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Akses Transaction History",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Buka detail alert yang ingin dianalisis\n• Klik tab **Transaction History**\n• Auto-load riwayat transaksi customer\n• Data di-fetch berdasarkan HPAN signature\n• Tampilan expandable card untuk detail lengkap",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.05),0 10px 30px rgba(59,130,246,.12);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;\"><div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3b82f6 0%,#2563eb 50%,#1d4ed8 100%);padding:18px 20px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.15) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:18px 18px;\"></div><div style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"><div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"><path d=\"M3 10h18M7 15h1m4 0h1m-7 4h12a3 3 0 003-3V8a3 3 0 00-3-3H6a3 3 0 00-3 3v8a3 3 0 003 3z\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.01em;\">Activity Ledger</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);margin-top:2px;\">Historical Transaction Trace</div></div><div style=\"margin-left:auto;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:20px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.2);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">📊 History</span></div></div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:14px 16px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#64748b;font-weight:600;\">Based on HPAN signature</span><span style=\"padding:4px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#eff6ff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#3b82f6;\">25 Records</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Transaction Card Overview",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Setiap transaksi ditampilkan dalam card\n• **Status Icon**: ✅ Success (Response 000) / ❌ Failed\n• **Reference Trace**: UTRNNO untuk tracking\n• **Amount**: Converted amount dengan mata uang\n• **Date**: Transaction date & time\n• **Rule Indicator**: Badge jika rule triggered\n• Klik card untuk expand detail lengkap",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fde68a;overflow:hidden;border-left:4px solid #f59e0b;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16a34a,#15803d);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\"/></svg></div><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\"/></svg></div><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:6px;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:2px;\">Reference Trace</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;font-family:monospace;\">#123456789</div></div><div style=\"text-align:right;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:2px;\">Transaction Date</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">01/12/2024</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:8px;padding-top:8px;border-top:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:900;color:#16a34a;\">Rp 2,500,000</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;font-weight:600;\">Purchase - E-Commerce</div></div><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#fff7ed;border:1px solid #fed7aa;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#ea580c;\">⚡ Rule Triggered</span></div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Expanded Details - General Info",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik card untuk expand & lihat detail lengkap\n• **General Information**:\n  - STAN (System Trace Audit Number)\n  - RRN (Retrieval Reference Number)\n  - Auth Source (Authorization source)\n  - Risk Value (Risk assessment score)\n  - Currency & Available Balance\n• Data dikelompokkan dalam sections yang jelas",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #eef2ff;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6366f1,#4f46e5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 16v-4M12 8h.01\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">General Information</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f8fafc,#fff);\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;\">STAN</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">123456</div></div><div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;\">RRN</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">987654321098</div></div><div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;\">Auth Source</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">VISA</div></div><div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;\">Risk Value</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">HIGH</div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Expanded Details - Merchant & Location",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Merchant & Location Details**:\n  - Merchant Name & Address\n  - City, State, Country\n  - Postal Code\n  - GPS Coordinates (Latitude, Longitude)\n• Berguna untuk:\n  - Verify merchant legitimacy\n  - Detect location anomalies\n  - Geo-fencing validation\n  - Cross-border transaction checks",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f5f3ff;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b5cf6,#7c3aed);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0118 0z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Merchant & Location</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f8fafc,#fff);\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:2px;\">Merchant Name</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">ABC Electronics Store</div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:2px;\">Address</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#475569;\">Jl. Sudirman No. 123, Jakarta Pusat</div></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;\">City / State</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Jakarta, DKI Jakarta</div></div><div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;\">Country</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Indonesia</div></div><div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;\">Postal Code</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">10220</div></div><div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;\">Coordinates</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">-6.2088, 106.8456</div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Security & Authentication Details",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Security & Authentication**:\n  - PIN Auth Flag\n  - CVV / CVV2 Auth Flag\n  - 3DS (3D Secure) Flag\n  - EC Auth Indicator\n  - Card Status\n  - Cross Border indicator\n  - VRM Scoring\n• Critical untuk fraud investigation\n• Identify weak authentication points\n• Detect bypassed security measures",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #99f6e4;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0fdfa;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#14b8a6,#0d9488);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;\">Security & Authentication</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f8fafc,#fff);\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;margin-bottom:10px;\"><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#14532d;\">PIN Auth</span><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#16a34a;\">✓ YES</span></div><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#14532d;\">CVV Auth</span><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#16a34a;\">✓ YES</span></div><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#7f1d1d;\">CVV2 Auth</span><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#dc2626;\">✗ NO</span></div><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#14532d;\">3DS Flag</span><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#16a34a;\">✓ YES</span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">🌐 Cross Border: TRUE</span><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;\">VRM Score: 75</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
